**Enkoa** is one of the four Viaan nations. It lies in the historical region of [[vianis-river-delta|Vianis River Delta]], where the Cuthage Empire once thrived. It was formed during [[bleeding-rivers|Bleeding Rivers]] and is a forerunner in republican politics.

# History

# Geography
## Thebamnus
Thebamnus is region leading into the Pheris region. It is separated into two parts centering around the two roads. Linking the [[naanuath-empire|Naanuath Empire]] to [[the-rift|The Rift]] along the Vianis Delta coast.
* ![](assets/images/Zenin-COA.svg) *Zenin*
* Linnan
* Konstantin
* Altemir

## Pheris 
The Pheris region is centered around the Romanis river delta. It encompasses the deep forests to the flat coasts. It is centered around the Spine, the roadway that connects Enkoa to the heartlands of [[yuashir|Yuashir]] and continues into faraway lands in [[praetia|Praetia]].
* ![](assets/images/Romanikha-COA.svg) *[[romanikha|Romanikha]]*
*  [[ivarsk|Ivarsk]]
* Boras
* Revik
* Maajs
* Retavas

## Amphon
The Amphon region is a large region in the east of Enkoa. There are deep forests with far stretched farmlands scattered in between. It serves as the crucial link between Enkoa and the [[yuashir|Yuashir]] capital of Krinci Vas.
* ![](assets/images/Stugrad-COA.png) *[[stugrad|Stugrad]]*
* Irkhiv
* Csihar
* Sempeter
* Marathon

# Military
*[[order-of-the-enkoan-military|Order of the Enkoan Military]]*
The Military in Enkoa is divided in three branches: The Hollow Horde are the local guard made up off irregulars, the Keepers are the standing army and the Iprenron are the elite guard of the Stadholder-General and traditional warriors under [[aenar|Aenar]]. The complete organization is under the guidance of the Field Marshal.

**National Military**
